WEBVTT

00:02:58.396 --> 00:03:01.436
that is not an independent nation --

00:03:01.436 --> 00:03:02.876
yet -- to publish --

00:03:02.916 --> 00:03:03.916
(Laughter)

00:03:03.956 --> 00:03:04.956
(Applause)

00:03:04.996 --> 00:03:06.236
to publish

00:03:07.516 --> 00:03:10.476
an indicative, nationally
defined contribution

00:03:10.516 --> 00:03:14.876
showing how we will meet
the objectives of the Paris Agreement.

00:03:14.916 --> 00:03:19.516
So we've pledged to cut emissions
by three quarters by 2030

00:03:19.556 --> 00:03:23.516
and to be net zero by 2045.

00:03:23.556 --> 00:03:28.836
We're also seeking to galvanize
change on the global stage.

00:03:28.876 --> 00:03:32.476
So we are currently
the cochair of a coalition